        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86432, Traditional Newport Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Newport Knob is made by Emtek so you can be assured it encompasses all the beauty and attention to quality for which Emtek is known. The Newport Cabinet Knob is available in 2 sizes and an array of stunning finish color options. Each knob comes packaged with the mounting hardware. The Emtek Newport Knob is great for use on kitchen cabinets, in the bathroom, or on furniture.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86432-specifications.gif?v=1704354780\" width=\"600\" height=\"198\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86432 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Art Deco Newport Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>86432: Small</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86433: Large</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
